I can reproduce this on main. Here's a complete reproducer:

```
$ curl -u elastic:password -H "Content-Type: application/json" "127.0.0.1:9200/languages_lookup" -XPUT -d '{
  "mappings": {
        "properties": {"language_code": {"type": "keyword"}, "language_name":{"type": "keyword"}}}, "settings": {"index": {"mode": "lookup"}}}'

$ curl -u elastic:password -H "Content-Type: application/json" "127.0.0.1:9200/languages_lookup2" -XPUT -d '{
  "mappings": {
        "properties": {"language_code": {"type": "keyword"}, "language_name":{"type": "keyword"}}}, "settings": {"index": {"mode": "lookup"}}}'

$ curl -u elastic:password -HContent-Type:application/json 'localhost:9200/languages_lookup/_doc?refresh' -d'{"language_code": "1", "language_name": "English"}'

$ curl -u elastic:password -HContent-Type:application/json 'localhost:9200/languages_lookup2/_doc?refresh' -d'{"language_code": "2", "language_name": "English2"}'

$ curl -u elastic:password -H "Content-Type: application/json" "127.0.0.1:9200/_query?format=txt" -d '
{
  "query": "from languages_lookup2 | rename language_name as ln | lookup join languages_lookup on language_code"
}
'

 language_code |      ln       | language_name 
---------------+---------------+---------------
1              |English        |English        
2              |English2       |null
```
